    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Text field in which the regulations on which the public service is based can be described."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Rich Text (HTML) is allowed. Note: must not contain executable (JavaScript) code and anchor tags with relative urls.\r\nPreferably use the relationship 'follows(Rule)' to refer to the relevant legislation."@en;
