    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "YourEurope category under the Single Digital Gateway Regulation. Only services that fall within one of these categories should be forwarded to SDG. The categories and subcategories were determined by the European Parliament. These were translated by the IPDC - LPDC team into a code list in the absence of a European code list."@en;
